Airplane — third-party attributions
=====================================

Airplane is original work by its contributors (see LICENSE, Apache-2.0),
with selected UI adapted from the following MIT-licensed projects:

1. Pugdon
   Copyright (c) cajuuh
   License: MIT
   Source: https://github.com/cajuuh/pugdomv2

   What was adapted (apps/mobile): the theme system (src/theme — coats,
   shape, typography, theme context and themed-styles helper), the i18n
   infrastructure and English dictionary shape (src/i18n), the floating
   glass TabBar (components/TabBar), the TopBar shell (components/TopBar),
   the Timeline / Thread / Settings / Setup screens (screens/), the
   compose sheet (components/ComposeModal), the dialog host
   (components/Dialog), and the ui primitives (components/ui). All were
   rebranded to Airplane, stripped of accounts/federation concepts the
   product doesn't have (anonymous by design), and re-driven by
   services/airplane instead of Mastodon APIs. New Airplane files written
   in the same visual language (e.g. components/MeshStatus.tsx) are
   original work, not Pugdon code.

2. panel-ui
   Copyright (c) panel-ui
   License: MIT
   Source: https://github.com/panel-ui/panelui

   What was adapted (apps/mobile): panel-ui component primitives vendored
   via the panel-ui CLI (see apps/mobile/panelui.json and
   apps/mobile/panelui-lock.json), used as the base for shared UI
   primitives in components/ui.

